The sequence analysis is highly decisive: it is an exact match to Arabidopsis PLASMODESMATA CALLOSE-BINDING PROTEIN 3 (PDCB3), with an N-terminal signal peptide, X8 domain, proline/serine-rich stalk, and C-terminal GPI-anchor signal. I will now record and review these findings before summarizing.

